@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title 4.1 — Kiến trúc triển khai theo cấu hình source
top to bottom direction
node "Trình duyệt (Thymeleaf/Bootstrap)" as F
node "Gateway :8080" as G
node "Eureka :8761" as E
package "Service nghiệp vụ" {
node "Identity :8081" as I
node "Course :8082" as C
node "Assignment :8083" as A
node "Blog :8084" as B
node "Chatbot :8085" as H
}
database "MySQL / 4 database" as SQL
database "MongoDB" as M
database "Redis" as R
cloud "MinIO / dịch vụ ngoài" as X
F --> G : HTTP / SSE
G --> I
G --> C
G --> A
G --> B
G --> H
G ..> E : discovery / lb
I --> SQL
C --> SQL
A --> SQL
B --> SQL
C --> M
A --> M
H --> M
H --> R
I ..> X : upload / email / OAuth
C ..> X : tài nguyên / Calendar
A ..> X : Judge0 / AI client
H ..> X : LLM
legend bottom
Mô hình theo cấu hình, không phải chứng cứ đã deploy.
AuthFilter gắn theo route; downstream tin header nên cần mạng nội bộ bảo vệ.
Production compose không kèm sẵn database/cache/storage.
endlegend
@enduml